        "action": "Fund Meningitis B (MenB) Vaccine for all university students ",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "In June 2026, the NHS only offered the MenB vaccine to students starting university in the coming autumn. We believe university students of all years should be offered the vaccine, particularly those who study medicine, nursing, or veterinary studies.",
